  "description": "We built this development module, which includes many tasks that are needed but lack readily available resources. Many developers find that building these modules in their projects requires significant effort, time, and complexity. Among the module's tasks are integration with security and authentication systems, multi-client management (Keyclaok), and caching, enabling easy data access and caching. Many more functions will be explained in detail with each library update.",
